---
{
  title: "eject"
}
---
### NAME

    eject() - Removes and returns an element at a specific index.

### SYNOPSIS

    mixed eject( mixed ref *arr, int index );

### DESCRIPTION

    Removes and returns an element at a specific index.

### PARAMETERS

    index  (int)
           Index of element to remove

### RETURN VALUES

    (mixed) The removed element
